sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM/SGLang Pods
    participant EPP as EPP (Endpoint Picker)
    participant Prom as Prometheus / Thanos Querier<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Collector as WVA Metrics Collector
    participant SatEngine as WVA Saturation Engine
    participant SFZEngine as WVA Scale-From-Zero Engine
    participant Cache as WVA Decision Cache<br/>(in-memory)
    participant Actuator as WVA Actuator<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant DirectAct as WVA Direct Actuator
    participant KEDA as HPA / KEDA
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS mTLS

    Note over vLLM,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling Loop

    vLLM->>Prom: Expose metrics (KV cache, queue,<br/>token throughput, latency)<br/>HTTP (scraped)
    EPP->>Prom: Expose scheduler_attempts_total,<br/>flow_control_queue_size<br/>HTTP (scraped)
    Collector->>Prom: GET /api/v1/query<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA)
    Prom-->>Collector: Metric values (per-replica)
    Collector->>SatEngine: Per-variant metrics
    SatEngine->>SatEngine: V2 Token/Capacity Analysis<br/>or Queueing Model (M/M/1/K)
    SatEngine->>Cache: Store scaling decision<br/>(desired replicas per variant)
    Cache->>Actuator: Read decisions
    Actuator->>Prom: Expose wva_desired_replicas<br/>via /metrics endpoint<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KEDA->>Prom: Query wva_desired_replicas<br/>HTTPS/9090, Bearer Token
    Prom-->>KEDA: Desired replica count
    KEDA->>K8sAPI: PATCH scale subresource<br/>mTLS, SA Token

    Note over vLLM,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Scale-From-Zero

    EPP->>Prom: Expose flow_control_queue_size<br/>HTTP (scraped)
    SFZEngine->>Prom: Query queue_size (100ms poll)<br/>HTTPS/9090, Bearer Token
    Prom-->>SFZEngine: Queue size > 0 for zero-replica model
    SFZEngine->>K8sAPI: PATCH Deployment/LWS replicas = 1<br/>scale subresource<br/>mTLS, SA Token

    Note over vLLM,K8sAPI: Flow 3: ConfigMap-Driven Configuration Update

    Note right of K8sAPI: ConfigMap change<br/>(kubectl / GitOps)
    K8sAPI-->>Collector: Informer event:<br/>ConfigMap updated
    Collector->>SatEngine: Updated config applied<br/>(thread-safe hot-reload)
